      <h2 id="nodes-pods-plugins-device-mgr_nodes-pods-device" class="group scroll-mt-20">Understanding the Device Manager<a href="#nodes-pods-plugins-device-mgr_nodes-pods-device" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Device Manager advertises specialized node hardware resources through device plugins, enabling pods to consume hardware devices without requiring upstream code changes.</p>
      <p>Device Manager provides a mechanism for advertising specialized node hardware resources with the help of plugins known as device plugins.</p>
      <p>You can advertise specialized hardware without requiring any upstream code changes.</p>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Important</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
          <p>OpenShift Container Platform supports the device plugin API, but the device plugin Containers are supported by individual vendors.</p>
        </AlertDescription>
