      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the <code>DevicePlugins</code> feature gate. Set to <code>true</code>.</p></dd>
      </dl>
      </li>
      <li>
      Create the Device Manager:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc create -f devicemgr.yaml"} lang="terminal" />
      <CodeBlock code={"kubeletconfig.machineconfiguration.openshift.io/devicemgr created"} lang="terminal" title="Example output" />
      </li>
      <li>Ensure that Device Manager was actually enabled by confirming that <em><strong>/var/lib/kubelet/device-plugins/kubelet.sock</strong></em> is created on the node. This is the UNIX domain socket on which the Device Manager gRPC server listens for new plugin registrations. This sock file is created when the Kubelet is started only if Device Manager is enabled.</li>
